From 49c8840b342854d8910815a1130295431b9dde08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:48:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! v2: swap CTransaction and BlockMerkleRoot to V2 v7
 wire format

Retain canonical native transactions in wallet notifications and wallet database loads. Replace WithV2OutputScripts, which rewrote native output bytes and then failed strict construction, with a read-only lookup of scripts committed by known plain native branches. Use that lookup for ownership, keypool bookkeeping, address and change queries; never rewrite transaction wire, identity or kind.

The original native and OFF binaries reproduce notification-worker FATAL after8/9blocks for both unnamed and named SQLite wallets. The repaired OFF binary recovers all four preserved failed test wallets, mines to101, rescans from0, reports mature balance and101transactions, preserves wallet-vs-chain native raw bytes, and restarts/rescans cleanly. Fresh unnamed/named OFF and native cases also pass restart/rescan. A focused C++ regression preserves the exact transaction pointer/wire/TxId/TxHash/native kind while a known branch resolves and an unrelated branch remains unowned. No grammar relaxation, database migration, native-to-legacy conversion or new native sender is introduced.

Tier: V2
